Number of ruined castles = 220 * 0.4
Number of ruined castles = 88

Step 2: Determine how many of the ruined castles are unmanned. Half of the ruined castles are unmanned, so we multiply the number of ruined castles (88) by 0.5.

Number of unmanned ruined castles = Number of ruined castles * 0.5
